{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 题解 · 程俊英、蒋见元 · 题解","description":"風 · 邶風 · 擊鼓 · 《詩經注析》关于“题解”的注脚：清乔亿言此诗乃\"征戍诗之祖\"(剑溪说诗又编) 。全诗五章，前三章概括了从应征入伍至行伍涣散这一过程，笔墨简洁，揭示深刻。通过陪衬和烘托来突出主题…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"031-ji-gu","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","glossId":"0002-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","poem":{"id":"031-ji-gu","title":"擊鼓","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"beifeng","path":["風","邶風","擊鼓"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"击鼓其镗","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"踊跃用兵","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"土国城漕","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"我独南行","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"从孙子仲","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"平陈与宋","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"不我以归","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"忧心有忡","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"爰居爰处","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"爰丧其马","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"于以求之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"于林之下","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"死生契阔","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"与子成说","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"执子之手","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"与子偕老","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"于嗟阔兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"不我活兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-019","text":"于嗟洵兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-020","text":"不我信兮","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"annotation":{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":7,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"题解","targetNotes":"题解第二段","sourceLabel":"第 60 页","sourceNotes":"书页 60 的题解下段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"题解","text":"清乔亿言此诗乃\"征戍诗之祖\"(剑溪说诗又编) 。全诗五章，前三章概括了从应征入伍至行伍涣散这一过程，笔墨简洁，揭示深刻。通过陪衬和烘托来突出主题，是此诗在表现手法上值得注意之处。第三章对丧马归林、失伍离次的描写，表现出当时士卒的怨愤叛离之状，于生动具体的形象中寄意，倍觉真切。这是征人思念家室之作，其所欲言，不单在于从军之苦。第四章笔锋一转，忽追述当日执手相誓、期以偕老之事，与前面所写的战乱景况对照，更加显出此日情状的可悲。末二章所表现的情境，对后世诗歌创作，影响甚大。如托名苏武的别诗、陈琳的饮马长城窟行、杜甫的新婚别，写征人与家室的别离之恨，均深得其意。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"全篇总说","title":"题解","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0002","order":2,"layerLabel":"全篇总说","title":"题解","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0002-1","isCurrent":true},{"id":"0003","order":3,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"击鼓其镗，踊跃用兵。土国城漕，我独南行。","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0003-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0004","order":4,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"从孙子仲，平陈与宋。不我以归，忧心有忡。","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0004-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0005","order":5,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"爰居爰处，爰丧其马。于以求之，于林之下。","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0005-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0006","order":6,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"死生契阔，与子成说。执子之手，与子偕老。","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0006-1","isCurrent":false},{"id":"0007","order":7,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"于嗟阔兮，不我活兮。于嗟洵兮，不我信兮。","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0007-1","isCurrent":false}],"previous":{"title":"题解","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1"},"next":{"title":"击鼓其镗，踊跃用兵。土国城漕，我独南行。","href":"/shijing/gloss/031-ji-gu/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0003-1"},"gloss":{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"题解","text":"清乔亿言此诗乃\"征戍诗之祖\"(剑溪说诗又编) 。全诗五章，前三章概括了从应征入伍至行伍涣散这一过程，笔墨简洁，揭示深刻。通过陪衬和烘托来突出主题，是此诗在表现手法上值得注意之处。第三章对丧马归林、失伍离次的描写，表现出当时士卒的怨愤叛离之状，于生动具体的形象中寄意，倍觉真切。这是征人思念家室之作，其所欲言，不单在于从军之苦。第四章笔